---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Krillion.si">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-invert">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Effective Date: October 4, 2026</p>
    <p>
      At Krillion.si, we prioritize player privacy. We do not require registration, login, or personal account creation to enjoy any game mode on our platform.
    </p>
    <h2>Information Collection</h2>
    <p>
      We do not collect personally identifiable information. Gameplay inputs and scores are processed locally on your client browser. We may use privacy-preserving web analytics and standard advertising partners (e.g. Google AdSense) to keep the service free for players worldwide.
    </p>
    <h2>Cookies & Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits. Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Ads Settings in their browser.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
